ind":"announcement","title":"1500 WISHLISTS","summary":"Hello adventurers!We are so excited to announce that we reached over 1500 wishlists! That's almost a 6x since launching the Steam Demo 2 weeks ago!Thank you so much for supporting us by playing our demo and leaving great feedback. We're so very glad you're on this journey with us :)And to everyone who has played the game already: We'd really appreciate an honest review on Steam, positive or negative. It helps us improve and helps other players decide! Thanks a lot!Cheers,Chiara, David and Dennis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:07:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043170","verified_at":"2026-10-26T02:54:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1847286114033170","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"announcement","title":"1000 WISHLISTS","summary":"Hello adventurers!We are over the moon to announce that we reached over 1000 wishlists!Thank you so much for supporting us by playing our demo and leaving great feedback. We're very glad you're on this journey with us :)And to everyone who has played the game already: We'd really appreciate an honest review on Steam, positive or negative. It helps us improve and helps other players decide! Thanks a lot!Cheers,Chiara, David and Dennis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:20:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033170","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:46:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846651706693527","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.32.0 (October 19, 2026)","summary":"Hello adventurers! We just released our Steam Next Fest update which adds some new content, more languages, and many improvements. New Added the Brood Rat, a new monster in rooms 3 and 4Added two Volatile Crystal upgrades to the skill tree that make it possible to build a streak so picked up materials have a chance to gain a tierAdded the Branch Manager achievement for maxing every upgrade in the skill tree Balance Made Rare Monsters and destructibles appear at a steadier rate, without long unlu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:08:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693527","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846651706689894","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"announcement","title":"750 WISHLISTS","summary":"Hello adventurers!We are so happy to announce that we reached over 750 wishlists!We're releasing a special update for Steam Next Fest today that will include a new enemy, new localizations and a sneakier Treasure Kobold as well as a lot of other improvements!Thank you so much for supporting us by playing our demo and leaving great feedback. We're very glad you're on this journey with us :)And to everyone who has played the game already: We'd really appreciate an honest review on Steam, positive ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:58:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689894","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846651706684781","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"announcement","title":"500 WISHLISTS","summary":"Hello adventurers!We are so happy to announce that we reached over 500 wishlists! Thank you so much for supporting us by playing our demo and leaving great feedback. We're very glad you're on this journey with us :)Cheers,Chiara, David and Dennis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:08:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684781","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846651706676037","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.31.1 (October 15, 2026)","summary":"FixesFor right-to-left system languages (such as Arabic or Hebrew): Fixed the interface showing mirrored, with the minimap on the left and the HUD on the right","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T01:30:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676037","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846018067942937","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.31.0 (October 13, 2026)","summary":"Hello adventurers!We just released some more improvements based on the demo feedback we've received so far.ImprovementsStopped the extraction window's monster waves from counting as progress which made some later runs feel like less progress being when using the fast extractionAdded a combat text for when a Slash kills a Vulnerable Monster (Executed!)World map news are now optional, which makes the Enter Dungeon button in the skill tree not being hidden in those casesMoved the world map update f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:26:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846018067942601","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.30.0 (October 12, 2026)","summary":"Hello adventurers!We just released some improvements based on the demo feedback we've received so far (and some other fun stuff we wanted to add).NewAdded a new story scene with Boris at the start of a new game (and several other connected things) BalanceReworked leveling so skill points no longer pile up earlyShockwave now unlocks after clearing room 4, just before you meet Armored Goblin Rippers, instead of after killing 2 of themMonsters killed while Soul Reaper is active no longer drop Souls","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T01:15:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942601","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563740-1846018067935393","game_id":"steam-4563740","kind":"announcement","title":"The playtest is over - it's time for the demo!","summary":"Demo out nowHello adventurers! We just released the demo of Outliers: Incrementum after closing down our September playtest. Thank you so much for your feedback and interest in our game.Here's a little sneak peak of what's new:two new enemy types with distinct mechanicsadditional boss mechanicsin-game achievements to claimsome easter eggs 👀The demo is now also available in 5 languages:EnglishGermanPortuguese (Brazil)Portuguese (Portugal)Simplified ChineseWe're already working hard on the full ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T05:07:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935393","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4563740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:53:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:53:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4563740":"2026-